================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

This project performs no machine learning of its own. It orchestrates models and
runtimes built and released by others, all under permissive licences. Their
authors deserve the credit for the parts that do the hard work.

Models
------

Whisper (speech recognition)
    OpenAI. MIT License.
    Code and model weights: https://github.com/openai/whisper
    Used here via pre-converted CTranslate2 weights published by SYSTRAN.

OPUS-MT (machine translation)
    Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki.
    Apache License 2.0.
    https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP
    Specifically opus-mt-es-en and opus-mt-fr-en, converted locally to
    CTranslate2 by scripts/fetch_models.py.

Silero VAD (voice activity detection)
    Silero Team. MIT License.
    https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
    The ONNX graph is downloaded and run directly on ONNX Runtime.

